it_game"><h2>Play game</h2><a class="button fat play_btn" href="https://hat0-hato.itch.io/natu2026miruksg">アイスウォーター&#039;s itch.io page<svg class="svgicon icon_arrow_up_right" version="1.1" width="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" role="img" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden height="24"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></section><section class="jam_comment_form"><h2>Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4816612" data-register_action="comment">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p></section><section id="comments" class="jam_comment_list"><h2>Comments</h2><div id="community_topic_posts_5977148" class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget"><div id="community_post_list_7119639" class="community_post_list_widget base_widget"><div class="community_post sidebar_avatar" id="post-17097098" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:13385794,&quot;id&quot;:17097098}"><div id="first-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div id="last-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/hagure-22"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MTU0NTkyLnBuZw==/80x80%23/gDf8HQ.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/hagure-22">はぐれ者＠VIPRPG</a></span><span title="2026-08-23 07:08:33" class="post_date"><a href="/post/17097098">58 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>前作（GW）に続いての新キャラのようなのでプレイしました。<br>ただ、今回のはなんか内容の無さが目立った感じです。<br>魔法具現化同士の馴れ合い絡みな作品は正直印象に残りにくい。<br>新キャラのデビューなら何らかの活躍が欲しかった。<br>前作はわりとそれができていたのでちょっと残念です。</p><p>キャラグラのバリエーションの多さと良さはいい感じです。<br>これを元に更なる活躍があることを期待します。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a data-register_action="community_vote" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4816612&amp;intent=community" class="post_action vote_btn"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4816612&amp;intent=community" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><script id="vote_counts_tpl" type="text/template"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class="upvotes">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class="downvotes">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="footer"><div class="primary"><div class="social"><a href="https://twitter.com/itchio"><span class="icon icon-twitter" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="screenreader_only">itch.io on Twitter</span></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/itchiogames"><span class="icon icon-facebook" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="screenreader_only">itch.io on Facebook</span></a></div><a href="/docs/general/about">About</a><a href="/docs/general/faq">FAQ</a><a href="/blog">Blog</a><a href="/support">Contact us</a></div><div class="secondary"><span class="copyright">Copyright © 2026 itch corp</span><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/directory">Directory</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/terms" rel="nofollow">Terms</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/privacy-policy" rel="nofollow">Privacy</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/cookie-policy" rel="nofollow">Cookies</a></div></div><script id="loading_lightbox_tpl" type="text/template"><div class="lightbox loading_lightbox" aria-live="polite"><div class="loader_outer"><div class="loader_label">Loading</div><div class="loader_bar"><div class="loader_bar_slider"></div></div></div></div></script><script type="text/javascript">new I.CommunityViewTopic('#community_topic_posts_5977148